<title>UK: South Africa sets $300 mln 10-year Yankee bond.</title>
<headline>South Africa sets $300 mln 10-year Yankee bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following Yankee bond was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SOUTH AFRICA</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	COUPON     8.375     MATURITY    17.OCT.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.156    PAY DATE    17.OCT.96</p>
<p>			    REOFFER    99.156    SPREAD	+195 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	BAA3	S&amp;P	  BB+</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
